     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">202</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">军训大</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">合唱比赛活动方案</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一、活动主题</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    为丰富新生军训生活，活跃校园文化 ，增强集体荣誉感和团队意识，为新生搭建一个展示自我的舞台，激发广大同学的积极性，特举办202</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">级</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">红歌</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">合唱比赛。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、活动目的</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    通过学习演唱红歌</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">军歌</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，达到文化育人的目的。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三、参加对象：202</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">级全体</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">生</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四、比赛地点：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">图书馆三楼报告厅一 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五、比赛时间：8月29日下午13:30-15:00</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">六</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、评分标准</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次活动从“唱歌、着装、人数、会场秩序以及演出创意”5个方面进行评比,每个方面独立评分</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">唱歌（音准、气势、情感、整齐度、熟练度）——70分</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">着装（是否整齐）——10分</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.演出创意（演出形式新颖、主题鲜明，并能紧随时代步伐深受学生喜欢）——20分</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.会场秩序——本环节无加分项（如活动开始集合秩序混乱，活动过程中连队纪律松散将在该连队最终成绩基础上扣除5分）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">七</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、比赛要求：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.比赛曲目要求自选一首红歌或军歌参赛，（原则上在参考曲目中选）。如选唱歌曲演出创意新颖、主题鲜明，并能紧随时代步伐深受学生喜欢将给与相应加分。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2. 以班级为单位，全体学生参加，要求各班统一服装，特点鲜明，形式多样。但是必须要有一名指挥，要求手势到位，注重力度和风格。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3. 曲目上报要求：请高一各班在8月2</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日放学以前将电子表格上传到公共文件夹/德育处/</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">202</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">军训红歌大合唱比赛”。</span></p><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 21.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 7pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 7pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 7pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">附：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023”</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">军训红歌大合唱比赛</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">节目登记表</span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0.35in;" class="firstRow"><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 106.5pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班级</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 106.5pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">节目名称</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid wind